{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And Zilpah bore.</b> For all of them pregnancy is mentioned, except for Zilpah — because she was the youngest of them all, a young girl in years, and pregnancy was not noticeable in her. And in order to deceive Jacob, Laban gave her to Leah, so that he would not realize that Leah was being brought to him — for such is the custom: to give the older handmaid to the older and the younger to the younger."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:12.771761421Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}